%% Sequence 4: estimate approval after diagnosis.
sequenceDiagram
  actor Desk as Front desk
  participant Tablet as Mechanic's tablet
  participant Shell as JavaFX shell
  participant API
  participant Kernel
  participant Store as Storage
  participant Bus as Event bus

  Tablet->>API: work items and parts after diagnosis
  API->>Kernel: add work items
  Kernel->>Store: order -> Approval
  Kernel->>Bus: EstimateReady
  Bus->>Shell: notify the front desk
  Shell->>Desk: estimate 4,300 RUB
  Desk->>Shell: customer approved by phone
  Shell->>Kernel: approve (who and how)
  Kernel->>Store: order -> In progress
  Kernel->>Bus: EstimateApproved
  Bus->>API: broadcast
  API-->>Tablet: you can start
  Note over Kernel: Below the "no call needed" threshold the kernel approves on its own.<br/>Later: the customer approves by a link from Telegram.
